OL,3,GNEWSAWaste activity stopped at site
OL,4,Aunder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA skip firm has been ordered to stop
OL,7,Fits activity after concerns over an
OL,8,Funauthorised tip.
OL,10,FLand at the MD Waste Management Ltd
OL,11,Fsite on Edward Street in Hyde,
OL,12,FTameside, where a huge pile of rubbish
OL,13,Fhas appeared, does not have planning
OL,14,Fpermission for waste transfer activity,
OL,15,Fauthorities said.
OL,17,FThe Environment Agency (EA), Tameside
OL,18,FCouncil and Greater Manchester Police
OL,19,Fare working together to investigate and
OL,20,Fremove the waste from the land.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
